format: 3
name: an escape shape in a comment, which javac reads and the reference's reader does not (2)
class: Case
method: m
arg: 03
expect: REJECT none
note: ADR-065 I2c, scheduled for acceptance by M0.
note: ADR-068 D13: on frontend=JAVAC this agrees with the JVM (Adr068SavedCasesOnJavacTest).
---
import java.math.BigInteger;
public class Case { public static BigInteger m(BigInteger a) {
    return a // \u005c\\\u000a .add(a)
    ;
} }
